  "solution": "Given equation: (150 ÷ 3 + 15) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 135.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 15 and 6\n\nGiven: (150 ÷ 3 + 15) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 135.\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**150 ÷ 3**__ + 6) ÷ 3 × 15 + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ (__50____** + 6**__) ÷ 3 × 15 + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ (__50____ + 6__) ÷ 3 × 15 + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ __**56**____** ÷ 3 × 15**__ + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ __280____** + 30**__ = 135\n\n⇒ 310 ≠ 135\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 150 and 135 **\n\nGiven: (150 ÷ 3 + 15) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 135\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**135 ÷ 3**__ + 15) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 150\n\n⇒ (**__45__**__** + 15**__) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 150\n\n⇒ __**60**____** ÷ 3**__ × 6 + 30 = 150\n\n⇒ __20____** × 6**__ + 30 = 150\n\n⇒ __120 + 30__ = 150\n\n⇒ **150 = 150**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 3 and 6 \n\nGiven: (150 ÷ 3 + 15) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 135\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**150 ÷ 6**__ + 15) ÷ 6 × 3 + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ (__25____** + 15**__) ÷ 6 × 3 + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ __**40 ÷ 6 × 3**__ + 30 = 135\n\n⇒ __20** + 30**__ = 135\n\n⇒ 50 ≠ 135\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 30 and 15\n\nGiven: (150 ÷ 3 + 15) ÷ 3 × 6 + 30 = 135\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**150 ÷ 3**__ + 30) ÷ 3 × 6 + 15 = 135\n\n⇒ (__50____** + 30**__) ÷ 3 × 6 + 15 = 135\n\n⇒ __8____0____** ÷ 3 × 6**__ + 15 = 135\n\n⇒ __**160 + 15**__ = 135\n\n⇒ 175 ≠ 135\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
